  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot gelecek sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Gelecek i\xE7in \"Ermi\u015F\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nB\xFCy\xFCk bir
    uyan\u0131\u015F ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftireceksin. Olaylar aras\u0131nda sebep sonu\xE7
    ba\u011Flant\u0131lar\u0131 kurarak, kendi \xE7\u0131karlar\u0131na olan tercihleri
    yapmakta ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131 olacaks\u0131n. Se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart, ge\xE7mi\u015Fte
    ba\u015F\u0131na gelen tats\u0131z olaylarda ne hay\u0131rlar oldu\u011Funu yava\u015F
    yava\u015F anlamaya ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor {{isim}}.
    Art\u0131k \xE7evrene sorular sormana ya da i\xE7sel s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131nla
    ilgili d\u0131\u015F d\xFCnyada bir aray\u0131\u015F i\xE7inde olmana gerek kalmayacak.
    Korundu\u011Funu, kolland\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve senin i\xE7in en hay\u0131rl\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n
    istendi\u011Fini anlayacak, huzur bulacaks\u0131n. Yar\u0131m kalan ya da ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131\u011Fa
    u\u011Frad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn i\u015Flerinle
    ilgili de yepyeni umutlar do\u011Facak."
